%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrap": true, "width": 130, "actorMargin": 40, "messageMargin": 28, "noteMargin": 6}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant PR as Processing repair<br/>or event Lambda
  participant Q as SQS media-results
  participant RS as MediaResults
  participant DB as media_db
  actor C as Browser or Publisher
  participant M as MediaApi
  participant S as S3 output bucket
  PR->>Q: publish due outbox rows (results v2, v3)
  Q->>RS: results (any order, at least once)
  RS->>DB: inbox dedupe, validate_transition, projection → done
  C->>M: GET /api/media/jobs/{id} (via Gateway, trusted actor)
  M->>DB: owner-filtered asset + projection
  M-->>C: done, presigned MP4 URL (900 s), hls_url (no-store)
  C->>S: GET MP4 with Range (206)
  C->>M: GET .../hls/master.m3u8
  M->>S: read playlist
  M-->>C: playlist
  C->>M: GET .../hls/v1/seg00000.ts
  M-->>C: 307 to presigned S3 URL
  C->>S: GET segment
